          "text": "Wakatanda muntu, alimwi kulubazu lwakujwe lwa-Edeni wakabika baangelo bakerebimu apanga lyamabekabeka ilyakali kuyumbana koonse koonse kusinkila inzila yamusamu wabuumi.",
